# Google Play service-account key, read by eas.json submit.production.android.
# NEVER COMMITTED: this key can publish to the Play Store on the account
# owner behalf. It lives on the machine that runs eas submit, and in EAS
# credentials for CI - never in the repo.
play-service-account.json
*-service-account.json
